# Include-list counterpart of exclude_unquoted_hash_comment_f90.tau (issue
# #64). Quoted, "#keep_routine" would whitelist only keep_routine. Unquoted,
# the leading '#' starts a comment, so the include list stays empty and both
# subprograms keep their timers. The instrumentor warns and suggests quoting
# the line. Include-list whitelisting exists only in the Fortran frontend.
BEGIN_INCLUDE_LIST
#keep_routine
END_INCLUDE_LIST
